      "message": "docs(mcp): camcraft-mcp skill lists set_tool_cutter_params; a drawn neck feeds the checks\n\nAdds the set_tool_cutter_params row (its params and neck shape from\ncrates/app/src/mcp/cutter_tools.rs). set_tool_cutter_profile's \"display\nonly\" note is corrected: the collision checks and the simulation read a\ndrawn neck where it is narrower than the stated shank (never wider).\nPROCESS_VERSION 31.\n\nFixes #1013\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
